# OLDER INSTALLS ONLY. Keys for your own gateway routes (config.local.yaml) used to
# go in services/litellm/local.env (gitignored). They now go in your club-3090
# settings, in secrets.env (mode 0600):
#   bash scripts/settings.sh set MY_CLOUD_API_KEY=<key>
# A local.env you already have is still loaded, and a key saved in your settings wins
# over it. `bash scripts/settings.sh migrate` copies the keys your routes use across.
